   "what": "For the quarter ended 25 Oct, Nvidia reported revenue of $115.8 billion, up 103% from a year earlier. Data Center revenue was $107.6 billion. The company guided next-quarter revenue to $130.0 billion, plus or minus 3%, with no China data center sales assumed. CNBC puts the analyst average at $125.1 billion. Colette Kress is interim CEO while a search runs.",
